sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Ada Novak
  participant B as Bob Tully
  actor C as Charlie Dunn
  A->>B: ping
  B-->>A: pong
  A->>A: think
  Note over A,B: shared note
  loop Every minute
    B->>C: ping
    opt busy
      C->>C: wait
    end
  end
  alt ok
    C->>B: ack
  else failed
    C-xB: fail "x" < y & z
  end
  par first
    A->>B: one
  and second
    A->>C: two
  end
  Note right of C: done
